        <span>Rebuilding this site as a two-ink zine. You're reading issue no. 001.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="when">Ongoing</span>
        <span>Shipping No. 10 — a political simulator with a soul, in Godot 4.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="when">Ongoing</span>
        <span>Writing daily journals that get pushed to an e-paper tablet every morning.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="when">Ongoing</span>
        <span>Small iOS apps, one travel scrapbook, too many side projects.</span>
